  "root_cause": "The alerting checker read a field named '.scientific_receipt_path' on each KPI file and treated its absence as evidence of unsigned data. Every KPI in this schema family (amphora.solvency-score.phase0-kpi.*) is a thin pointer object: it has no top-level 'signature' key by design and instead carries a 'receipt_path' field pointing at a separate, fully DSSE Ed25519-signed parent receipt under reference/mvp20/data/. The field name the checker looked for does not exist in this schema; the field that does the same job is 'receipt_path'. This is a field-name mismatch in the checker, not evidence that any unsigned artifact was committed.",
